  "question": {
    "text": "An electric bulb is rated as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>. What will be the peak magnetic field at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> distance produced by the radiations coming from this bulb? Consider this bulb as a point source with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></math> efficiency.",
